  "review": {
    "gallery": "One dated construction photo, three photos of the August duplex show residence, three photos of the May simplex show residence, and three project renders. Show homes are identified as such. Shared generic amenity renders were not selected.",
    "location": "OMNIYAT’s distinct ORLA marker and the published ORLA locator. The nearby Madena road estimates are attributed to Madena’s West Crescent reference point.",
    "floorPlans": "42 unique full residence sheets across three original developer publications. The brochure plans for 203 and 206 match current launch-page totals and take precedence over Madena’s 7,796 and 10,529 sq ft versions. The brochure sheet for 208 prints 7,308 sq ft versus 7,310 sq ft on the other sheet. The unit-specific document for 403 prints 7,326 sq ft versus 7,409 sq ft in the earlier brochure. Unit 808 retains the drawing’s 7,446 sq ft with the current launch-page 7,352 sq ft conflict stated on-page. Minor differences between summed rounded components and printed totals are retained as published."
  },
  "unavailable": [
    "Verified entrance and finished-building photography. Complete public drawings for the triplexes, super penthouses, Luna Sky Palace and Beach Mansion were not obtainable from the inspected public documents. The ResaleDXB document returned HTTP 403, World City returned an access page, and OMNIYAT’s sales-offer buttons require contact details."
  ]
